{"feed":{"entry":[{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom","xmlns$blogger":"http://schemas.google.com/blogger/2008","xmlns$georss":"http://www.georss.org/georss","xmlns$gd":"http://schemas.google.com/g/2005","xmlns$thr":"http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0","id":{"$t":"tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-6818054921907446479.post-5442053233033376503"},"published":{"$t":"2013-06-17T20:18:00.003+02:00"},"updated":{"$t":"2013-06-24T21:00:08.841+02:00"},"title":{"type":"text","$t":"Informačná tabuľa Pružina"},"content":{"type":"html","$t":"<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\nČlenovia Občianskeho združenia Hradiská dňa 16. 6.2013 osadili v Pružine pri osade Ritka (dnes Riedka), pod svahom <a href=\"http://www.hradiska.sk/search/label/Pru%C5%BEina%20-%20Mescisk%C3%A1\" target=\"_blank\">slovanského hradiska Mesciská</a> novú informačnú tabuľu, ktorá odteraz bude turistov, idúcich po modrej turistickej (aj cyklistickej ) trase &nbsp;upozorňovať na to, že sa oplatí &nbsp;urobiť krátke vybočenie z trasy a navštíviť toto výnimočného hradiska.&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br />\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center;\"><tbody>\n<tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgnCEnzjuP7_zhQY1vMtdoK4PENrDNc02RYWBktdziK3h4t546CeN0s_LH0p2ICuZvhUmmBmgwK3RTgIZM5mVXcWPuPssPJAhgkO6W-lmK6WphgIxjxGllqEb62T6smX5qkaZuo3KuBDf0/s1600/Mapa+10000+kri%CC%81z%CC%8Cik.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"159\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgnCEnzjuP7_zhQY1vMtdoK4PENrDNc02RYWBktdziK3h4t546CeN0s_LH0p2ICuZvhUmmBmgwK3RTgIZM5mVXcWPuPssPJAhgkO6W-lmK6WphgIxjxGllqEb62T6smX5qkaZuo3KuBDf0/s320/Mapa+10000+kri%CC%81z%CC%8Cik.jpg\" width=\"320\" /></a></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\">červený krížik označuje približné miesto tabule</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEj2v6nbP60zFPS0HesjTxdXUMaVipwELvrbaol8vABcFZFWS0px_qGe4939ArjuxpvyJbNQjx4pb3OTcZ0xJgbfO5vrnbtylAQg4TQ_WmxjgdhYecwFmV31BgMgz_VFEKOn2xcdERMz3jk/s1600/AN_Pruz%CC%8Cina-Mesciska%CC%81+tab.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEj2v6nbP60zFPS0HesjTxdXUMaVipwELvrbaol8vABcFZFWS0px_qGe4939ArjuxpvyJbNQjx4pb3OTcZ0xJgbfO5vrnbtylAQg4TQ_WmxjgdhYecwFmV31BgMgz_VFEKOn2xcdERMz3jk/s320/AN_Pruz%CC%8Cina-Mesciska%CC%81+tab.jpg\" width=\"226\" /></a></div>\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\nNa osadenie sme sa dôkladne pripravili už v sobotu večer, kedy sme dorazili priamo na hradisko, kde sme si rozložili malé slovanské osídlenie. Kvalitné modranské a dobrá nálada nesmeli chýbať.<br />\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiatcxCsQfhUeNKXQlIh7lCGIczvoqUiy95pJvvt4taFPQUMguEYl-xYfPteV_onxKdcjGGGKrJjVG8DgL0r5Nizjt165s2_s4CXsDooDUJRklB9QNZR4dp5wgAMNrlcnLG28XNhkMV1ZA/s1600/IMG_9273.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"213\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiatcxCsQfhUeNKXQlIh7lCGIczvoqUiy95pJvvt4taFPQUMguEYl-xYfPteV_onxKdcjGGGKrJjVG8DgL0r5Nizjt165s2_s4CXsDooDUJRklB9QNZR4dp5wgAMNrlcnLG28XNhkMV1ZA/s320/IMG_9273.jpg\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEghhlIPYcOWiy_rcAumUzcMSd_qVCr6JJwxOWGgedubXIZVN_s8PC_meSY4NGFsv_UKtDB46qwOMZAwoEeXoLxPgnJODtzZZPjsKyUpHFTbOz1zzH8pfWeMt_1hOVgfDmc3KaP1S4G-qTo/s1600/IMG_9267.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"213\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEghhlIPYcOWiy_rcAumUzcMSd_qVCr6JJwxOWGgedubXIZVN_s8PC_meSY4NGFsv_UKtDB46qwOMZAwoEeXoLxPgnJODtzZZPjsKyUpHFTbOz1zzH8pfWeMt_1hOVgfDmc3KaP1S4G-qTo/s320/IMG_9267.jpg\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\nNasledujúci deň sme sa už pustili do samotného osadenia a odhalenia tabule.<br />\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiwn-a41e5yDrQQpGTeiX6QxeUEAP-oeXhj2FikFOnGyIcNkLA2AWB6hH-TM1tGSfuM-YSNM7dge3nNcyxDUexJQk_gabwQfNNQ_SY39wjiMC0Flwz6axEMr6Y-qweltyRzhpP2zMY-Db0/s1600/1014554_526369007423648_1105852891_o.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"213\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiwn-a41e5yDrQQpGTeiX6QxeUEAP-oeXhj2FikFOnGyIcNkLA2AWB6hH-TM1tGSfuM-YSNM7dge3nNcyxDUexJQk_gabwQfNNQ_SY39wjiMC0Flwz6axEMr6Y-qweltyRzhpP2zMY-Db0/s320/1014554_526369007423648_1105852891_o.jpg\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgPOkZJV_ps_ujeFTZ825XuEecU0S9Lfg9hxf_G-aj3AZSnyULaaepgor3F2THiGrkM3M0ivWZ2nvEzc8wwj7cKZ-G_V_h3vNmER6NS1MPSKk02zp8PpDhCIOatn3oE4u5BdTG2-cj_rY4/s1600/1014961_526369180756964_284388967_o.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"213\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgPOkZJV_ps_ujeFTZ825XuEecU0S9Lfg9hxf_G-aj3AZSnyULaaepgor3F2THiGrkM3M0ivWZ2nvEzc8wwj7cKZ-G_V_h3vNmER6NS1MPSKk02zp8PpDhCIOatn3oE4u5BdTG2-cj_rY4/s320/1014961_526369180756964_284388967_o.jpg\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgI6oBHTWr_oF3AgfFF21z4OjMwPqIfrrhbWfz29U84UEIZ63NGAr70Vitl6V5I2UV7TaMQ5GqrmdDAzH0Bk2wpml_Ws-KdUmoBYWBgro9es1MKV8mMWDP_kxi_tG4xA8S44vYNNZVY3yE/s1600/1025434_526369127423636_311447769_o.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"213\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgI6oBHTWr_oF3AgfFF21z4OjMwPqIfrrhbWfz29U84UEIZ63NGAr70Vitl6V5I2UV7TaMQ5GqrmdDAzH0Bk2wpml_Ws-KdUmoBYWBgro9es1MKV8mMWDP_kxi_tG4xA8S44vYNNZVY3yE/s320/1025434_526369127423636_311447769_o.jpg\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<br /></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgggAZJSyQrD0iR0ODvbdI0EhJHbudZ1FXTo1Hr0YBhsOhozcnzccm5ul3Cf5dCn4zyfhKb2cFtHUl6s9wTpgMHcX66I9DEzG5xaw7cW_eMfY_1pHxSQyjP9EEnkexwLccQpp5Wa5hZyk8/s1600/P6166193.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"240\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgggAZJSyQrD0iR0ODvbdI0EhJHbudZ1FXTo1Hr0YBhsOhozcnzccm5ul3Cf5dCn4zyfhKb2cFtHUl6s9wTpgMHcX66I9DEzG5xaw7cW_eMfY_1pHxSQyjP9EEnkexwLccQpp5Wa5hZyk8/s320/P6166193.JPG\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEico76RO6rDQp-dIgRmvwjTuT9o4mgAj6Q592Q727ETM1DMvkea_hVGnvNPrf8mfbRw-jgIzjoklz9NJREPWd88cX8IGbXmr06xC7K5ParIRBW22WIoVNtcQI_q4HcUKtkFuuqlUOabdjA/s1600/P6166195.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"240\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEico76RO6rDQp-dIgRmvwjTuT9o4mgAj6Q592Q727ETM1DMvkea_hVGnvNPrf8mfbRw-jgIzjoklz9NJREPWd88cX8IGbXmr06xC7K5ParIRBW22WIoVNtcQI_q4HcUKtkFuuqlUOabdjA/s320/P6166195.JPG\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhjNmbn9rFYbk4rhcdk7Gk_9F54nsclralqfXABHGJwTdjUoqYM0Vy15qx9nX9S4BBF8qU__lKk9WEmalgxeHgP3BgT1X47NwYw8Q-kpPRI-sfk_eL8-N5YYbxoOXcKvIhnTJyzHhvB1oE/s1600/1002404_526369374090278_916276233_n.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhjNmbn9rFYbk4rhcdk7Gk_9F54nsclralqfXABHGJwTdjUoqYM0Vy15qx9nX9S4BBF8qU__lKk9WEmalgxeHgP3BgT1X47NwYw8Q-kpPRI-sfk_eL8-N5YYbxoOXcKvIhnTJyzHhvB1oE/s320/1002404_526369374090278_916276233_n.jpg\" width=\"213\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n</div>\nNa našu nesmiernu radosť nás na miesto prišli podporiť členovia dnes už legendárneho archeologického krúžku v Považskej Bystrici <b>Štefan Meliš, Martin Olšovský, Ladislav Janech, Gašpar Zemančík a Stanislav Miko</b>. Boli to práve oni, ktorí hradisko v 90. rokoch objavili a zakreslili. Dozvedeli sme sa od nich veľké množstvo &nbsp;cenných informácií. Ďakujeme že si našli čas a zavítali medzi nás.<br />\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhM7kFA51gkIyDpGNzsC2px5jLu_ltUaK-ScvFfVoj3Dzn-r7BX_1FOwE-3lCS6jqMDxHaN5TuVoINuOLPp_t-0odFShcJuFN9ohQS0RnrCo2fblp7SODuf_UGnH-yUT82Rap9nvHA7An4/s1600/P6166200.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"240\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhM7kFA51gkIyDpGNzsC2px5jLu_ltUaK-ScvFfVoj3Dzn-r7BX_1FOwE-3lCS6jqMDxHaN5TuVoINuOLPp_t-0odFShcJuFN9ohQS0RnrCo2fblp7SODuf_UGnH-yUT82Rap9nvHA7An4/s320/P6166200.JPG\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<br />\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center;\"><tbody>\n<tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiPeB4_l9FI2FHRVgXnci-oWNbHIC1QeDmXcMFgcpybHTj_DkRJZCSwNLBo7hleWYh0OVCux2havbaOK1ESxX2yZCBjSlEIKpYD3Y2Kz7u07wR9fSlLrM_K34jH9g5JFtbQm4ZvKmpteQA/s1600/DSCN2789.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"240\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiPeB4_l9FI2FHRVgXnci-oWNbHIC1QeDmXcMFgcpybHTj_DkRJZCSwNLBo7hleWYh0OVCux2havbaOK1ESxX2yZCBjSlEIKpYD3Y2Kz7u07wR9fSlLrM_K34jH9g5JFtbQm4ZvKmpteQA/s320/DSCN2789.jpg\" width=\"320\" /></a></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\">pán Olšovský mal veľmi pozorných žiakov ...</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center;\"><tbody>\n<tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgxdZbQJq6YKqlcVRNrDXlvR6s6FF8yNT6JEHWFlkRtr_xlpqnX9-VsW5bjaulikI5bJ5poznc1B5SE-TwfV7jFmujMy6I3VjuPU89Rvy8QoSXuiQtFLR91pBHTI5bDOF30P085QpZQYaQ/s1600/DSCN2794.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"240\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgxdZbQJq6YKqlcVRNrDXlvR6s6FF8yNT6JEHWFlkRtr_xlpqnX9-VsW5bjaulikI5bJ5poznc1B5SE-TwfV7jFmujMy6I3VjuPU89Rvy8QoSXuiQtFLR91pBHTI5bDOF30P085QpZQYaQ/s320/DSCN2794.jpg\" width=\"320\" /></a></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: small; text-align: justify;\">Z ľava páni Miko, Janech, Olšovský, Meliš, Zemančík a členovia OZ Hradiská</span></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\nNašu snahu podporil aj starosta obce &nbsp;Michal Ušiak, ktorý nám vyšiel v ústrety a dodal štrk a cement a nechal vykosiť priestor, kde tabuľa bola umiestňovaná. Prisľúbil tiež preplatenie výrobných nákladov tabule. Za jeho prístup mu patrí veľká vďaka.<br />\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiIjyWPxcqW6K54QWXqyuCsxsQOKAAifNFTJo7dmlo9RkrLJ1hh49G-QH2sAMVdkB0fXP_LVPYi-N0MuHtkWByCXSIGaKmskLmiFU9U9p-WwzPltnnSDW_2sNQHQfvT-bKE72dk-IiixfE/s1600/P6166235.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"240\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiIjyWPxcqW6K54QWXqyuCsxsQOKAAifNFTJo7dmlo9RkrLJ1hh49G-QH2sAMVdkB0fXP_LVPYi-N0MuHtkWByCXSIGaKmskLmiFU9U9p-WwzPltnnSDW_2sNQHQfvT-bKE72dk-IiixfE/s320/P6166235.JPG\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n</div>\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjSj0xRBZ7v0FHSb6uztUdukd2DJSdixOS7DrwY3H9RvrfELinSr2KnjPTeHPdtBidWQkg5fhWI6KQ2kiD00s4wVrroB5YFmSMvTmyAy5uoEidtUWkS5RgavC_6_oEyO3968qpovr8Fhxc/s1600/P6166244.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"240\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjSj0xRBZ7v0FHSb6uztUdukd2DJSdixOS7DrwY3H9RvrfELinSr2KnjPTeHPdtBidWQkg5fhWI6KQ2kiD00s4wVrroB5YFmSMvTmyAy5uoEidtUWkS5RgavC_6_oEyO3968qpovr8Fhxc/s320/P6166244.JPG\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center;\"><tbody>\n<tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjqfT0QASG9ZBgu_h6Pv04WUAS1NrA3M6YL5tHyxjepA_4SlULOIV-5oMupqDmKbnjoWLVZH69ZD-N_lgNDHktoU-ElsvtE5h8vJ2zzGrYX0l7iZoCAaiwSGApQWnES1srCazMkz_yRW-M/s1600/P6166253.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"240\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjqfT0QASG9ZBgu_h6Pv04WUAS1NrA3M6YL5tHyxjepA_4SlULOIV-5oMupqDmKbnjoWLVZH69ZD-N_lgNDHktoU-ElsvtE5h8vJ2zzGrYX0l7iZoCAaiwSGApQWnES1srCazMkz_yRW-M/s320/P6166253.JPG\" width=\"320\" /></a></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\">bývalý a terajší starostovia Pružiny</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<br />\nTabuľu sme po dohode so starostom osadili na mieste ležiacom medzi Mojtínskym potokom a turistickým modrým chodníkom. Priamo od tabule vedie poľná cesta, ktorou sa v priebehu 5 minút dostanete pohodlne priamo na hradisko. Veríme, že toto miesto, ako aj samotné hradisko &nbsp;sa stane vyhľadávaným miestom pre turistov a všetkých záujemcov o našu slávnu históriu.<br />\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjnSlZFXNSCSKQ6YmiEkkmKogWFxTFVQBcqGlnj2_nCkuhnLMSSeG1Dho1hqK4w8tKOwr5d00xQzlq0plGNw4fgEPxj2ebulRe8DAVUykZxZumxsP3SAtyRuc3UeYCiPgCN4AuIc9uFTnM/s1600/IMG_9336.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"213\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjnSlZFXNSCSKQ6YmiEkkmKogWFxTFVQBcqGlnj2_nCkuhnLMSSeG1Dho1hqK4w8tKOwr5d00xQzlq0plGNw4fgEPxj2ebulRe8DAVUykZxZumxsP3SAtyRuc3UeYCiPgCN4AuIc9uFTnM/s320/IMG_9336.jpg\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgxIsGKairu5ZznzLhEDwAjuJQH9jWabTdpee-Pbqgr-ja4w_Md4lOD0J__H7GsCSkxsGnjPRYpwtIe5OCfnH6ukNamuC2IlH2RJ9a3eJ8DjyLogqJ1XHUiusk6hxxaBbVjE1fdwlMc4ss/s1600/IMG_9337.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgxIsGKairu5ZznzLhEDwAjuJQH9jWabTdpee-Pbqgr-ja4w_Md4lOD0J__H7GsCSkxsGnjPRYpwtIe5OCfnH6ukNamuC2IlH2RJ9a3eJ8DjyLogqJ1XHUiusk6hxxaBbVjE1fdwlMc4ss/s320/IMG_9337.jpg\" width=\"213\" /></a></div>\n<br />\nTešíme sa &nbsp;na ďalšiu informačnú tabuľu, ktorú osadíme v Modre ...<br />\n<br />\nFoto: Stanislav Miko<br />\nMiroslav Bros<br />\nSammi<br />\nOrgoň<br />\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhVXOS3Eq3cyw9U99PyCBQeBntQXYWxhtge8yJr01evOOEKwV46Q2HZzrZOBcaK49p2eSfBXifoMytQVsVSIhiB8_bU6jt2jiTis1EiTc3nmF4cHo0xZdqSLI7Ery7vGTLPigWqN_xkTi0/s1600/Hlavic%25CC%258Cka+web-stra%25CC%2581nky_2.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"95\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhVXOS3Eq3cyw9U99PyCBQeBntQXYWxhtge8yJr01evOOEKwV46Q2HZzrZOBcaK49p2eSfBXifoMytQVsVSIhiB8_bU6jt2jiTis1EiTc3nmF4cHo0xZdqSLI7Ery7vGTLPigWqN_xkTi0/s320/Hlavic%25CC%258Cka+web-stra%25CC%2581nky_2.jpg\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<br /></div>\n"},"link":[{"rel":"replies","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"http://www.hradiska.sk/feeds/5442053233033376503/comments/default","title":"Zverejniť komentáre"},{"rel":"replies","type":"text/html","href":"http://www.hradiska.sk/2013/06/informacna-tabula-pruzina.html#comment-form","title":"0 komentárov"},{"rel":"edit","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"http://www.blogger.com/feeds/6818054921907446479/posts/default/5442053233033376503"},{"rel":"self","type":"applicatio